WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.930
A few minutes on the clock.

2
00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.510
A student walks to the front of the class.

3
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.710
First words: Today I am
going to talk about rivers.

4
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:13.150
Ten seconds in, the audience is
already gazing out of the window.

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.210
So what makes a room of
classmates keep listening,

6
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.560
past that very first sentence?

7
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.340
In this mission, you'll
test the usual advice.

8
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:22.560
Pack in the facts?

9
00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.200
Tell a joke every minute?

10
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:28.840
You'll lay a talk out on a time bar,
and decide what each section has to do.

11
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:32.780
And you'll rank three openings
for a talk about the school day.

12
00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:36.070
Your mission: work out
what makes them listen on.
